---
title: Guardrails — Structure
layout: tree-down
hSpacing: 50
vSpacing: 120
---

input [class] "Input"
inguards [class] "Input Guards" { methods: "injection; PII" }
model [class] "Model"
outguards [class] "Output Guards" { methods: "schema; safety" }
deliver [class] "Deliver"
block [class] "Block / Redact"

input -> inguards
inguards -> model "clean"
model -> outguards "draft"
outguards -> deliver "safe"
inguards -> block
outguards -> block
